# ── Local credentials — NEVER commit ────────────────────────────────────────
# The agent stores its Oppex API key encrypted on disk. These patterns exist
# before the files do, deliberately: this repo is intended to be public, and
# git history is permanent, so a key committed once is exposed forever.
*.oppex-credentials
oppex-credentials*
config/local.*
**/application-local.properties
*.pem
*.key

# ── Java / Maven ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
target/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
dependency-reduced-pom.xml

# ── IDE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.settings/
.classpath
.project

# ── OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
